, benign digital assistant meant to cure"], [15.887, 17.712, "diseases, write our emails,"], [17.925, 19.188, "and boost the stock market."], [19.613, 21.013, "But behind closed doors,"], [21.188, 22.213, "a very different,"], [22.512, 25.4, "deeply unsettling reality is unfolding."], [25.812, 27.225, "In less than three years,"], [27.4, 30.587, "artificial intelligence won't just disrupt your industry\u2014"], [30.9, 32.463, "it is on track to make the very"], [32.475, 35.288, "concept of human labor entirely obsolete."], [35.7, 38.15, "And the creators of this technology are rushing"], [38.163, 40.737, "toward this cliff edge completely blind."], [41.15, 43.175, "Mass unemployment is just the tip of the"], [43.188, 43.737, "iceberg."], [44.163, 46.412, "What is truly terrifying is what happens when"], [46.425, 48.375, "the machine outgrows its masters,"], [48.612, 50.4, "begins to write its own code,"], [50.788, 52.513, "and escapes our control forever."]]}, "S02": {"frames": 3539, "words": [["We", 0.1, 0.2], ["have", 0.212, 0.325], ["always", 0.338, 0.738], ["been", 0.75, 0.912], ["comforted", 0.925, 1.425], ["by", 1.438, 1.55], ["the", 1.562, 1.637], ["historical", 1.65, 2.237], ["promise", 2.25, 2.763], ["that", 2.775, 2.962], ["new", 2.975, 3.2], ["technology", 3.212, 4.0], ["simply", 4.2, 4.575], ["creates", 4.588, 5.013], ["new", 5.025, 5.213], ["jobs.", 5.225, 5.825], ["When", 6.237, 6.337], ["we", 6.35, 6.475], ["invented", 6.487, 6.862], ["the", 6.875, 6.95], ["wheel,", 6.963, 7.338], ["we", 7.625, 7.737], ["needed", 7.75, 8.025], ["cart", 8.037, 8.275], ["drivers.", 8.287, 8.875], ["During", 9.287, 9.512], ["the", 9.525, 9.6], ["Industrial", 9.613, 10.25], ["Revolution,", 10.262, 10.862], ["we", 11.162, 11.275], ["needed", 11.287, 11.588], ["factory", 11.6, 12.075], ["workers", 12.088, 12.638], ["to", 12.65, 12.75], ["supervise", 12.762, 13.438], ["the", 13.45, 13.525], ["machines.", 13.537, 14.213], ["But", 14.625, 14.75], ["Artificial", 14.762, 15.35],